<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  shiroikuma fork — strings for the backup (保存復元) feature.

  Kept in a file of our own so upstream's Transifex-managed strings.xml never collides with it on a
  rebase. English here is the default and the fallback for every locale we do not ship; values-ja
  and values-cs carry the other two (白い熊, 2026-07-28).

  The app's own name stays literal in every locale.
-->
