    <plurals name="sk_files_confirm_own">
        <item quantity="one">One of them you sent yourself.\n\n“Free space” leaves every message exactly where it is — the other side keeps its copy, and that file stays downloadable here for as long as somebody in the conversation still has it.\n\n“Delete messages” takes the message away with the file, for every member and every one of your devices, permanently.</item>
